  "body": "It's in the spec since forever: https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/pull/198 / https://matrix.org/docs/spec/client_server/r0.4.0.html#get-matrix-client-r0-admin-whois-userid\r\n\r\nNote: https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/issues/1474 hints at the section possibly disappearing, but I can't remember what the decision was on this. https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/issues/1411 wants the \"appropriate\" APIs to be in the spec (through MSC).\r\n\r\n*let the arguments to (not) keep the endpoint in the spec begin*",
